<title>UK: CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATWEST TROPHY QUARTER-FINAL DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the quarter-finals of the NatWest Trophy made on Thursday:</p>
<p>Glamorgan v Yorkshire</p>
<p>Nottinghamshire v Essex</p>
<p>Derbyshire v Sussex</p>
<p>Middlesex v Warwickshire</p>
<p>Matches to be played on July 29.</p>
